{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53195","headline":"诗偈 二十 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 二十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"合瞋不须假，合喜不须喜。\n喜即婬慾生，瞋即毒蛇起。\n毒蛇起猛火，婬慾成贪鬼。\n猛火和贪鬼，痴狼咬心底。\n妄想如恒沙，烦恼无遮止。\n无明黑漆漆，渴来饮咸水。\n终日缘事走，不肯入空理。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53195.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53195","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}